# Command that reads a prompt on stdin and prints the model's answer on stdout.
# Rule: the judge must be a different model family than the builder (no self-grading),
# and HOLDOUT_CMD a third family (or blank). Set this before research/lock.sh for each phase.
#   Builder Claude (phase 1)            -> judge Codex
#   Builder Grok (omp --model grok-4.7) -> judge Codex or "claude -p"
# Grok headless (grok -p) did not answer the ~86 KB scoring prompt within 10 minutes on
# 2026-11-18, so it is not used as a judge or holdout.
JUDGE_CMD="codex exec --skip-git-repo-check -s read-only -"
HOLDOUT_CMD=""
